@startuml
mainframe Provision event ticketing

actor Operator
participant templateEndpoint
participant venueEndpoint
participant eventEndpoint

group create venue from spreadsheet template
Operator --> templateEndpoint: GET /template
note over Operator, templateEndpoint
Download and edit the spreadsheet template
to define venue areas and seats.
end note
Operator --> templateEndpoint: POST /template
Operator --> venueEndpoint: GET /venues
Operator --> venueEndpoint: GET /venues/{venueId}
Operator --> venueEndpoint: GET /venues/{venueId}/svg
Operator --> venueEndpoint: GET /venues/{venueId}/areas
Operator --> venueEndpoint: GET /venues/{venueId}/areas/{areaId}
Operator --> venueEndpoint: GET /venues/{venueId}/areas/{areaId}/seats
Operator --> venueEndpoint: GET /venues/{venueId}/seats?areaId={areaId}
Operator --> venueEndpoint: GET /venues/{venueId}/seats/{seatId}
end

group create and maintain event
Operator --> eventEndpoint: POST /events
note over Operator, eventEndpoint
Use X-Copy-From-Id to copy pricing
from an existing event when needed.
end note
Operator --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}
Operator --> eventEndpoint: PUT /events/{eventId}
Operator --> eventEndpoint: PATCH /events/{eventId}
Operator --> eventEndpoint: POST /events/{eventId}/poster
Operator --> eventEndpoint: DELETE /events/{eventId}/poster
end

group configure pricing
Operator --> eventEndpoint: POST /events/{eventId}/prices
Operator --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}/prices
Operator --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}/prices/{priceId}
Operator --> eventEndpoint: DELETE /events/{eventId}/prices/{priceId}
Operator --> eventEndpoint: PATCH /events/{eventId}/pricing
Operator --> eventEndpoint: PATCH /events/{eventId}/areas/{areaId}/pricing
Operator --> eventEndpoint: PATCH /events/{eventId}/seats/{seatId}/pricing
end

group manage sessions and monitor operations
Operator --> eventEndpoint: POST /events/{eventId}/sessions
Operator --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}/sessions
Operator --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}/sessions/{sessionId}
Operator --> eventEndpoint: PUT /events/{eventId}/sessions/{sessionId}
Operator --> eventEndpoint: DELETE /events/{eventId}/sessions/{sessionId}
Operator --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}/statistics
Operator --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}/sessions/{sessionId}/statistics
Operator --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}/orders
end

@enduml
